                            <version>2.1</version>
                        </software>
                    </software_list>
                    <details>Following definition of the class that featured the unique portal vertex, the metadata file was parsed to change sampling from 5x binning to 1.5x binning, and divide the dataset into two halves. Half-maps were calculated and processed to evaluate the FSC and for b-factor estimation.</details>
                    <number_images_used>5337</number_images_used>
